  DTS:Description="European commission calculation. Commission is earned on the VAT-exclusive net amount, converted to EUR at the month-average rate, and capped at the statutory per-country cap where one exists. Countries operating a works-council agreement accrue in the month of cash receipt rather than invoice, so those lines are held until payment is matched."
